sequenceDiagram
    participant P0 as Stimulus
    participant P1 as Sensory Receptor
    participant P2 as Sensory Neuron
    participant P3 as Spinal Cord
    participant P4 as Motor Neuron
    participant P5 as Effector Muscle
    P0->>P1: noxious stimulus
    P1->>P2: action potential
    P2->>P3: afferent signal
    P3->>P4: efferent signal
    P4->>P5: contraction (withdrawal)